&lt;li&gt;After training, understands and masters the product commissioning procedures, and is familiar with various product installation, commissioning, and maintenance manuals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in various commissioning skills, such as software upgrades, parameter configuration, DMC/HVAC settings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in troubleshooting various types of faults, capable of independent problem-solving, and can resolve commissioning challenges based on on-site conditions.&lt;/li&gt;
