&lt;li&gt;Summarize maintenance conditions based on the power station&#39;s daily maintenance report and regularly provide feedback to management on power station operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Safely store important tools and equipment issued to maintenance personnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates required skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gathers and analyzes information skillfully&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicates changes and progress&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balances team and individual responsibilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adapts to changes in the work environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follows instruction, responds to management direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates accuracy and thoroughness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Displays willingness to make decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upholds organizational values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proper use of PPE and observes safety and security procedures of BYD and adhere to customer safety and procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
