&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;sub&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The following description is not intended as an exhaustive list of all responsibilities, duties and skills required of personnel so classified. Management retains the discretion of adding or changing the duties of the position at any time.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;463&quot; data-end=&quot;485&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;467&quot; data-end=&quot;485&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;487&quot; data-end=&quot;872&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a Mechanical Engineer who brings a strong foundation in mechanical or manufacturing engineering and thrives in a customer-facing, product-driven role. This is a unique opportunity for someone who understands how things are made—but is equally comfortable engaging with clients, coordinating across departments, and driving products from idea to mass production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;874&quot; data-end=&quot;877&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;879&quot; data-end=&quot;907&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;883&quot; data-end=&quot;907&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
