&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;911&quot; data-end=&quot;1059&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;911&quot; data-end=&quot;964&quot;&gt;Own the end-to-end mechanical component lifecycle&lt;/strong&gt;—from concept validation through to mass production—focused on enclosures and structural parts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1060&quot; data-end=&quot;1205&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1062&quot; data-end=&quot;1205&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1062&quot; data-end=&quot;1092&quot;&gt;Act as a technical liaison&lt;/strong&gt; between internal teams (design, procurement, sales) and external stakeholders (customers, suppliers, factories).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1206&quot; data-end=&quot;1342&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1208&quot; data-end=&quot;1342&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1208&quot; data-end=&quot;1236&quot;&gt;Collaborate with clients&lt;/strong&gt; to define product requirements, ensuring feasibility across design, cost, and manufacturing capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1343&quot; data-end=&quot;1476&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1345&quot; data-end=&quot;1476&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1345&quot; data-end=&quot;1383&quot;&gt;Support business development teams&lt;/strong&gt; by offering technical insights during customer meetings, RFQ responses, and project scoping.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1477&quot; data-end=&quot;1628&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1479&quot; data-end=&quot;1628&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1479&quot; data-end=&quot;1526&quot;&gt;Translate technical needs into action plans&lt;/strong&gt;, guiding suppliers and contract manufacturers to align with quality, cost, and timeline expectations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1629&quot; data-end=&quot;1761&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1631&quot; data-end=&quot;1761&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1631&quot; data-end=&quot;1677&quot;&gt;Perform mechanical feasibility assessments&lt;/strong&gt; including Design for Manufacturability (DFM) and Design for Assembly (DFA) reviews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1762&quot; data-end=&quot;1899&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1764&quot; data-end=&quot;1899&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1764&quot; data-end=&quot;1797&quot;&gt;Oversee supplier coordination&lt;/strong&gt;, particularly for processes such as CNC machining, metal forming, die-casting, and surface finishing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1900&quot; data-end=&quot;2017&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1902&quot; data-end=&quot;2017&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1902&quot; data-end=&quot;1938&quot;&gt;Contribute to pricing strategies&lt;/strong&gt; by analyzing material costs, process efficiencies, and competitive benchmarks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2018&quot; data-end=&quot;2133&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2020&quot; data-end=&quot;2133&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2020&quot; data-end=&quot;2070&quot;&gt;Lead or support new product introduction (NPI)&lt;/strong&gt; activities, ramp-up phases, and factory readiness initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2134&quot; data-end=&quot;2262&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2136&quot; data-end=&quot;2262&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2136&quot; data-end=&quot;2179&quot;&gt;Stay up to date on manufacturing trends&lt;/strong&gt;, technologies, and customer needs across consumer electronics and related sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2264&quot; data-end=&quot;2267&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2269&quot; data-end=&quot;2291&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2273&quot; data-end=&quot;2291&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
