&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2293&quot; data-end=&quot;2391&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2295&quot; data-end=&quot;2391&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Mechanical Engineering, Manufacturing Engineering, or a related discipline.&lt;/p&gt;
