&lt;li&gt;4–7+ years of progressive accounting experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of GAAP and financial reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Excel skills and experience with ERP systems required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, problem-solving, and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
